. We are in the way of excellency in higher education but far away from the sea. I am hopeful about future to come and agree with P. B. Shelly \"If winter comes can spring be far behind?\"\nDr. Bimal Chandra Gogoi,\nPrincipal\nPAST EVENTS\nAt Sonari College, students are encouraged to get involved in a variety of activities. The college offers a variety of opportunities for students and teachers to get involved, so they can find something that they are passionate about. Here are some past events that are conducted at Sonari College\nRead more\nInauguration of Assamese Calendar  ‘Sonari ...\nInauguration of Assamese Calendar ‘Sonari Mahabidyalay Asomiya Calendar’, 12-04-2023\n24-01-2024\nRead more\nAwareness Program on \"City hounded by strays, ...\n24-01-2024\nRead more\nCourse Structure &  Information of KKHSOU  ...\nKKHSOU\nSonari College\nStudy Centre\nCentre Code:\n2408\nCentre-in-Charge :\nDr. Bimal ...\n05-04-2025\nRead more\nCultural Procession\nCommemorating 400th Birth Ceremony of Bir Lachit Barphukon\n24-01-2024\nRead more\nCultural Programme\nNAAC Peer Team Visit on 6th & 7th March 2024\n10-03-2024\nRead more\nCultural Programme\nNAAC Peer Team Vist on 6th and 7th March, 2024\n10-03-2024\nRead more\nEXIT MEETING\nNAAC Peer Team Vist on 6th and 7th March, 2024\n10-03-2024\nRead more\nHonourable NAAC Peer Team\nNAAC Peer Team Visit on 6th and 7th March 2024\n10-03-2024\nRead more\nInteraction with Alumni and Parents\nNAAC Peer Team Vist on 6th and 7th March, 2024\n10-03-2024\nRead more\nInteraction with Students\nNAAC Peer Team Visit on 6th and 7th March 2024\n10-03-2024\nView Past Events\nUpcoming EVENTS\nWelcome to the upcoming events calendar for Sonari College. We're excited to share with you all the great things that are happening on campus.\nUpcoming Events List\nFounded in 1970 and is affiliated to Dibrugarh University, Sonari college offers undergraduate degree courses in science and arts.\nContact Detail:\nP.O. Sonari , Dist. Charaideo, PIN – 78569